3:T59c,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is robotic knee replacement surgery?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Robotic knee replacement uses computer navigation and/or robotic arms to assist the surgeon in making precise bone cuts and positioning implants. This technology provides real-time feedback during surgery for optimal accuracy."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is robotic knee replacement better than traditional?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Studies show robotic/computer-navigated knee replacement provides more consistent implant alignment and may result in faster recovery. However, outcomes depend greatly on surgeon experience. Dr. Harsha combines advanced technology with 15+ years of expertise."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does robotic knee replacement cost in Hyderabad?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Robotic knee replacement in Hyderabad typically costs ₹3-5 lakhs, depending on the implant type and hospital. Contact our team for a detailed cost estimate based on your specific needs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the recovery time for robotic knee replacement?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most patients walk within 24 hours, go home in 2-3 days, and achieve full recovery in 3-6 months. Robotic precision often enables 20-30% faster recovery compared to traditional surgery."}}]}5:["slug","robotic-knee-replacement-hyderabad","d"]
